  TypeScript source was copied. Notice retained in
  THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES/JACKPOLL-MIT.txt.

* Live-Poll PowerPoint add-in (https://github.com/livepoll/live-poll-powerpoint),
  MIT License, archived. Used as a reference for the Office manifest structure
